      "description": "Send to Claude. Signal red, the only primary action.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.5 2.5L7 9M13.5 2.5l-4 11L7 9 2.5 6.5z\"/></svg>Send to Claude</button>",
