      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "One mark for task status. Done, in progress, blocked, ready, waits.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-rings\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"9\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#0b1f3a\" stroke=\"#0057b8\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"9\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#0057b8\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#0b1f3a\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"9\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#0057b8\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M6.7 6.7l4.6 4.6M11.3 6.7l-4.6 4.6\" stroke=\"#0b1f3a\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"9\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#0057b8\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"2.3 2.4\"/></svg></span>",
      "css": ".ds-rings{display:inline-flex;gap:8px}"
